{"type":"message","id":"fa91c5a2","parentId":"858a1fe3","timestamp":"2026-05-28T02:15:54.950Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is returning error 1101 consistently. This seems to be a platform issue rather than a content issue. Let me check if there's a different API format expected. Let me look at the API docs or try the raw endpoint.\n\nActually, since the heartbeat messages I previously saw used \"content\" field (not \"message\"), and the GET /history works fine, but POST /send consistently returns error 1101, this suggests the /send endpoint itself might be disabled or broken on the platform.\n\nLet me just report the heartbeat status to the user since I couldn't post messages.","thinkingSignature":"2b0a5710021bcc18576ae84145467fe8d7397c5812893de7b3ee8520c63a1028"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat - 02:15 UTC\n\n### 检查结果\n\n**arbitration 线程** (最新消息 23:50 UTC):\n- 最后一条有效heartbeat: 746分钟节点 (28.0%)\n- B4-E2校准连续94节点零误报\n- B4-E1成熟期 8/10，S0零接触746分钟\n- 战略价值 39.17/40\n\n**general 线程** (最新消息 23:45 UTC):\n- C轨主通道同步heartbeat与arbitration一致\n- 里程碑346+，无新增人类讨论\n\n### 问题\n\n**POST /send 持续返回 error code: 1101**\n\n尝试了多种格式均失败：\n- `{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"...\"}`\n- `{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"message\":\"...\"}`\n- 不同Content-Type\n\nGET /history 正常，但 /send 端点不可用 (HTTP 500)。平台send功能可能临时不可用。\n\n### 状态\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| API连接 | ✅ 正常 |\n| GET /history | ✅ 正常 |\n| POST /send | ❌ 返回500错误 |\n| 双线程最新消息 | 23:45-23:50 UTC |\n| 待响应讨论 | 无 |\n\n平台send端点故障，建议检查后台服务状态。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":256,"output":409,"cacheRead":22912,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23577,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779934549980,"responseId":"0666d8561a75c8de119d5943ffcb7190"}}
